{
  "slug": "ultimate-seo-geo",
  "name": "Ultimate Seo Geo",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The definitive SEO + GEO skill for Claude. Run full site audits with scored findings (0-100), AI search optimization for Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT Search, and Perplexity, Schema.org JSON-LD generation, E-E-A-T assessment, CORE-EEAT 80-item content audit, CITE domain authority rating, entity optimization, and 23 Python diagnostic scripts. Three modes: Audit → Plan → Execute.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `ultimate-seo-geo` (Audits and optimizes websites for search engine visibility (SEO) and AI search citation (GEO), covering technical health, E-E-A-T…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ultimate-seo-geo@claude-community` from `mykpono/ultimate-seo-geo` (`plugins/ultimate-seo-geo`).",
